<title>UK: BOE FORECASTS 2.0 BLN STG SHORTAGE, OFFERS HELP.</title>
<headline>BOE FORECASTS 2.0 BLN STG SHORTAGE, OFFERS HELP.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England offered the UK money market an early round of assistance after forecasting a liquidity shortage of around 2.0 million stg.</p>
<p>The operations will comprise repos to August 28 and September 1, outright offers of bills maturing on or before September 1 and offers of CGO holdings of 8-3/4 percent Treasury loan 1997 at a clean price of 100.03685.</p>
</text>
